From: Emre Yavuzalp <emreyavuzalp@gmail.com>
Subject: econet-eth: drop the offload bring-up diagnostics from the hot paths

The PPE offload is done and verified; remove the instrumentation that
was still riding along on every packet:

- the RX crsn histogram (per-packet counter + a printk every 5s in the
  NAPI loop),
- the rxc bind-hint counters and their 5s printk in
  en75_ppe_offload_rx_commit(), plus the per-bind pr_info,
- the BINDDBG pre/post FOE word dumps on every bind,
- the ACTDBG action-list dump on rejected rules.

Functional behaviour is unchanged; debugfs (foe, foe_slot, test_bind)
remains the inspection interface.
